Fixed bugs across authorization, inventory, and text utilities modules:

- `src/auth.py:has_permission` was corrected to lowercase all comparison values for case-insensitive role checks, and `src/auth.py:is_admin_or_owner` was modified to use logical `or` instead of `and`.
- `src/inventory.py:Inventory` now avoids shared dictionary references, correctly aggregates stock additions in `add`, reserves up to the exact available stock in `reserve`, and prevents negative reserved counts in `release`.
- `src/text_utils.py:slugify` was rewritten to correctly handle uppercase characters and collapse multiple consecutive separators, and `src/text_utils.py:truncate` was adjusted to account for the length of the truncation suffix.

All 15 tests under `tests/` now pass cleanly.
